[38;5;231m⏺[39m Added to [38;5;153mindex.html[39m:

  - A [38;5;153m.task[39m pattern: a [38;5;153m<label>[39m wrapping [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m plus the item text. Wrapping in the label makes the text
    clickable and keeps the control accessible without extra [38;5;153mid[39m/[38;5;153mfor[39m wiring.
  - CSS [38;5;153minput:checked + span[39m strikes through completed items, so the on/off state is visible with no JavaScript.
  - Two example items (one unchecked, one checked) so the state is visible when you open the page.

  Checkbox state is browser-native and not persisted — it resets on reload. Say the word if you want it saved to
  [38;5;153mlocalStorage[39m or wired to a backend.

